{"turn_id": "d26-t1", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "overall_metrics", "text": "系统对超出上下文问题的评估采用了宏平均精确率（macro precision）、召回率（recall）和F-1值作为指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_scores", "text": "在Bench'It数据集上，系统的宏精确率、召回率和F-1分别为64.14%、64.33%和63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_metrics", "text": "共指消解模型在CALOR测试集上使用精确率、召回率和F-1进行评估，平均分别为65.59%、48.86%和55.77%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "evaluation_scope", "text": "评估涵盖了超出上下文的问题以及共指消解模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d26-t2", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "evaluation_scope", "text": "论文指出，所提出系统各单独组件的评估是在本工作范围之外进行的；论文评估了超出上下文问题以及共指消解模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_dataset", "text": "超出上下文问题的表现是在 Bench'It 上评估的，该数据集包含 150 个法语一般知识开放性问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_scores", "text": "系统在 Bench'It 上达到了宏平均精确率、召回率和 F-1 分别为 64.14%、64.33% 和 63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_dataset_and_scores", "text": "共指消解模型在 CALOR 的测试集上评估，获得了平均精确率、召回率和 F-1 分别为 65.59%、48.86% 和 55.77%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "english_f1_comparison", "text": "同一模型在英文上达到了 68.8% 的平均 F-1；法语没有可比的测量结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "french_lower_f1_reason", "text": "论文认为法语的 F-1 分数较低，原因是标注数据量较少。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
